# Vocabulary that must never appear in this repo, one entry per line.
# Entries are extended-regex fragments, joined with | and matched case-insensitively.
#
# Copy to `.vocab-denylist` (gitignored) and fill in the nouns of the codebase you
# extracted from: the product name, its domain nouns, its test accounts, its
# vendors. The real list stays out of git on purpose, because committing a private
# product's nouns to a public repo publishes exactly what the gate exists to remove.
#
# A fork with nothing to scrub can ignore this entirely: with no denylist the gate
# skips.

# acme-corp
# widget
# admin@example\.test
